The mapmem.sys driver now also checks the registry entry
"\HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\3Dfx Interactive\Shared\DisableP6WCfix"
to determine whether or not to detect and correct a bug in the Intel
441FX P6 chipset that affects write combining on P6 processors.

If the registry entry is not present or has a non zero value,
the fix will not be done.  If the entry has a value of 0, the
chipset will be checked and a failing configuration will be
corrected.

